    "observations": [
      "Inspected final unit at full cell size and 115px beside all 12 current allies plus unchanged Wynne and Astrid, on forest background and as black silhouettes.",
      "Actual scalp crown below the topknot is cyan y62, chin gold y209. The face and eyes are visibly larger than NEW-002; wrapped open hands remain readable.",
      "Broad stance retained:419px silhouette width versus410px NEW-002; gold sash/hips higher, knees still bent and soles level. Kael remains widest of the three new units; equipment/capes can extend other allies silhouettes.",
      "Final portrait matches the new rounder chibi face, dark hair/topknot, amber eyes, calm mouth and umber/gold costume.",
      "Garran chin re-inspected at y235, not y198 used in NEW-002 lineup (which crossed his face). Hair guide y66 retained.",
      "Cross-character SIFT is supplementary: Garran scale0.984/15inliers is ok; Corin scale1.006/4inliers is not-measured. No numerical anatomy pass inferred for Corin.",
      "No runtime integration or game playtest performed; all previews are offline composites. Owner selection and approval still required."
    ]
